\v 38 As Yeshua continued teaching¦33335, he¦33337 said¦33337, “\wj Watch out¦33338 for these religious¦33341 teachers¦33341 who like to¦33349 wear \+add fancy\+add* robes¦33348 and¦33328 be¦33349 greeted¦33351 in the¦33353 square,\wj*
\v 39 \wj and have the best seats¦33357 at meetings and the best places¦33362 at dinners.\wj*
\v 40 \wj These¦33380 people trick widows¦33372 out of¦33371 their properties, but¦33373 offer long¦33377 prayers to cover it up. They will¦33381 be¦33381 getting a stricter judgement¦33384 than others.\wj*”
\s1 The sacrificial donation of a widow
