\r (Mat. 24:3-14; Luke 21:7-19)
\p
\v 3 Later when they were over on¦33555 the Mount¦33557 of Olives¦33559 overlooking the temple¦33562, Peter¦33569 and Yacob and Yohan¦33573 and Andrew¦33575 were with Yeshua and asked¦33563
\v 4 when¦33578 all this destruction would happen, and¦33581 what indications there would be that it would be about to happen.
\p
\v 5 So¦33597 \nd Yeshua\nd* told them, “\wj Be careful so you¦33609 aren't misled¦33610 by others.\wj*
\v 6 \wj Plenty of people will say¦33619 that they're coming¦33614 \+add ≈because they were sent by me\+add*, or that they \+em are\+em* me, and¦33625 they'll mislead¦33628 many¦33626 others.\wj*
\v 7 \wj And¦33634 whenever¦33629 you¦33631 hear¦33631 about wars¦33636 or about battles about to begin, don't¦33638 be¦33639 worried—those things will certainly happen, but¦33643 there's more to follow.\wj*
\v 8 \wj Countries will take up arms against other countries, and kingdoms against other kingdoms. There'll¦33657 be earthquakes¦33658 in¦33659 \+add many\+add* places¦33660 and there'll¦33662 be famines¦33663, but¦33652 those will be just like the¦33667 beginning¦33667 of¦33668 birth¦33668 pains¦33668.\wj*
\rem /s1 Persecution Foretold
\p
\v 9 “\wj So be careful. You'll be turned over¦33678 to \+add local\+add* councils¦33683 \+add for questioning\+add*, will be whipped in the Jewish¦33686 meeting¦33686 halls¦33686, and will be stood¦33696 in front of governors¦33691 and kings¦33695 because¦33701 of following me¦33700. But¦33684 you'll be able to present your life stories to them\wj*\x + \xo 13:9-11: \xt Mat 10:17-20; Luk 12:11-12.\x*
\v 10 \wj and¦33704 it's¦33715 right that the¦33717 good¦33718 news first\wj*\f + \fr 13:10 \ft TD: It's not clear here what was meant by ‘first’—‘first’ before what?\f* \wj be¦33716 proclaimed¦33716 to¦33705 every people group.\wj*
\v 11 \wj But whenever¦33724 they¦33726 bring¦33726 you along to hand you over, don't¦33730 worry¦33731 in advance about what you're going to say to defend yourselves, but wait until the hearing proceeds and speak¦33733 what you are given¦33740 then, because¦33752 then it won't¦33730 be you speaking¦33756, but \+add ≈God's\+add* \+nd spirit¦33759\+nd*.\wj*
\v 12 \wj In those times, a brother will report on his brother to have him executed, and a father¦33770 report on his child¦33771, and children¦33776 will be encouraged to report on their own parents¦33778 and then¦33762 they'll be executed as a result.\wj*
\v 13 \wj And every one will hate you¦33783 all¦33783 because¦33787 they hate my¦33790 name¦33789, but¦33792 anyone who endures¦33793 to¦33794 the¦33795 end¦33795 will be¦33797 saved¦33797.\wj*\x + \xo 13:13: \xt Mat 10:22.\x*
\s1 Yeshua warns about coming horror and deceptions
