\p
\v 14 “\wj But whenever¦33798 you see¦33801 the most horrible thing that drives people from God, standing¦33816 where¦33817 it¦33819 shouldn't¦33818 be¦33822 (and you readers should understand¦33822 this), then¦33825 anyone in¦33827 Yudea¦33829 should flee¦33830 into the hills\wj*\x + \xo 13:14: \xt Dan 9:27; 11:31; 12:11.\x*
\v 15 \wj and¦33836 anyone upstairs looking outside shouldn't¦33840 come¦33841 down¦33841 into the bedrooms to¦33848 get anything¦33849,\wj*\x + \xo 13:15-16: \xt Luk 17:31.\x*
\v 16 \wj and¦33855 anyone working outside shouldn't¦33861 go back¦33865 inside to get a change of¦33871 clothes.\wj*
\v 17 \wj It will be extremely difficult for pregnant women and¦33878 for mothers who are breast-feeding their children¦33877 in those¦33883 days¦33885.\wj*
\v 18 \wj Just pray that¦33889 it¦33891 won't¦33890 happen in¦33895 the¦33895 winter¦33895\wj*
\v 19 \wj because¦33898 those¦33901 days¦33900 will¦33897 be¦33897 terrible like nothing that's ever happened before, all the way back to when \+nd God¦33918\+nd* created¦33913 the world right until¦33919 the present time¦33920, and¦33923 won't¦33906 ever happen again.\wj*\x + \xo 13:19: \xt Dan 12:1; Rev 7:14.\x*
\v 20 \wj And if \+nd Yahweh¦33933\+nd* hadn't shortened that time, no¦33940 humans would¦33941 even survive, but¦33945 he shortened that time so that the¦33954 chosen¦33949 ones could be saved¦33942.\wj*
\p
\v 21 \wj So¦33956 don't¦33974 believe¦33975 it¦33975 if¦33959 you¦33961 hear someone¦33960 say¦33962, ‘Look¦33964, the \+nd messiah¦33968\+nd* has arrived here¦33965.’ or¦33970 ‘There's¦33973 the one that God has sent.’\wj*
\v 22 \wj Plenty of fake messiahs¦33981 and deceiving prophets¦33983 will certainly come and even do things that humans can't normally do, so much so that even the¦33997 chosen¦33998 ones would defect if¦33994 that were possible¦33995.\wj*
\v 23 \wj So watch¦34001 out¦34001, but¦34000 I've¦34003 warned you¦34004 in advance about all¦34004 of this.\wj*
\s1 The universe collapses as the son arrives
