\r (Mat. 26:14-16; Luke 22:3-6)
\p
\v 10 Then¦34500 Yudas¦34503 Iscariot¦34505, one¦34507 of¦34509 Yeshua's twelve¦34510 \add apprentices\add*, visited the¦34509 chief¦34514 priests¦34514 to offer to hand Yeshua over¦34517 to them¦34520.
\v 11 When¦34523 they heard¦34524 this, they were¦34525 very pleased and promised¦34528 to pay him well, and Yudas asked them about the most convenient¦34538 way¦34535 for them to get hold of Yeshua.
